# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads to Cloud Build. WITHOUT this file, gcloud falls back to
# .gitignore -- which ignores *.png and only re-includes docs/img/*.png, so the docs/img/fig/*.png
# figures (force-added to git) never got uploaded and 404'd in the deployed app. This file replaces
# that fallback: exclude the big/irrelevant dirs, but keep docs/ (UI + all figures) intact.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.claude
data/
results/
manuscript/
dp4_8vdl/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.ipynb
*.log
.DS_Store
